Description: TotTag dashboard helper for Bluetooth and USB
 Lets the TotTag dashboard, through its browser extension, reach TotTags
 without the browser's device chooser: it scans for tags nearby over
 Bluetooth, so several can be picked at once, and lists the tags plugged in
 over USB.
